<p class="mb-2">
  The Web UI reports through your <%= details[:type] %> <code>Karafka.producer</code>, the same producer your application uses.
  A fatal error on this producer affects all its dispatches, including the Web UI reports.
</p>

<p>
  This is a valid setup. If you prefer to keep the Web UI reporting separate, configure a
  <a href="https://karafka.io/docs/Web-UI-Configuration/#using-a-custom-web-ui-producer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">custom Web UI producer</a>.
</p>
